-- parse/bad: a declaration's `@ownership_summary_size` (`ownership-v2.md`
-- §4.4) is one of its lines, so the import after it comes after a
-- declaration: `import_after_declaration` (9:1); the attribute, which no
-- declaration follows, is `invalid_ownership_summary_size` (8:1). A
-- module's attribute, in the preamble, may come before the imports.


@ownership_summary_size(70000)
import List


f = 1
